# Duplicate-copy artifacts ("foo 2.js") from file-sync tooling. They are stale
# copies, never edited, and a `git add -A` sweeps them in silently.
# Any digit, not just 2: the sync tool went on to produce a set of "foo 3.js".
* [0-9].js
* [0-9].jsx
* [0-9].json
* [0-9].sql
* [0-9].md
scratch/
